    "lawCode": "Amd §200.55, Pen L; amd §486, Gen Bus L",
    "lawSection": "Penal Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S3564\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\nAn act to amend the penal law and the general business law, in\nrelation to crane inspectors\n\n\n PURPOSE OF BILL :\nThis bill is a chapter amendment to chapter 463 of the laws of 2008\nwhich established the offense of impairing the integrity of a\ngovernment licensing examination and amended the general business law\nin relation to crane inspectors.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\nSection one amends Subdivision four of section 200.55 of the penal\nlaw, as added by chapter 463 of the laws of 2008, to clarify that the\nprohibited conduct must be wrongful in nature. Section two amends\nsection 486 of the general business law, as added by chapter 463 of\nthe laws of 2008, to revoke an inapposite provision.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\nIn enacting chapter 463 of the laws of 2008, it was found that these\ntechnical changes were necessary to fulfill the legislative intent of\nthis measure.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\nNew Bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately and shall be deemed to have\nbeen in full force and effect on and after November 1, 2008.\n",
